OL,3,GNEWSALabour ends power-sharing with
OL,4,AGreens in 11 councils over Zionism row
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Green Party said it was "hugely
OL,7,Fdisappointed" that Labour had forced
OL,8,Flocal leaders into "jeopardising
OL,9,Fsuccessful progressive partnerships
OL,10,Fthat are delivering benefits for
OL,11,Fresidents".
